hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1243","Amr bin Khalid ne hamein bayan kiya unhon ne kaha Abul Malih ne hamein bayan kiya unhon ne kaha main ne Maimun yaani Ibn Mihran ko suna unhon ne kaha main ne Nafe se poocha kya Ibn Umar ziyafat ke liye dawat diya karte the unhon ne kaha lekin ek martaba un ka ek oont toot gaya to hum ne use zibah kar diya phir unhon ne kaha Madina walon ko mere paas jama karo Nafe ne kaha to main ne kaha ae Abu Abdur Rahman kis cheez par hamare paas roti nahi hai to unhon ne kaha ae Allah tere hi liye hamd hai ye haddi ka gosht hai aur ye shorba hai ya unhon ne kaha shorba aur boti hai pas jo chahe khaye aur jo chahe chhor de."
"1244","Saib bin Yazid rahmatullahi alaih se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya Quraish ke kuch log Hazrat Ibn Masud raziyallahu anhu ke darwaze par khare rehte taake kuch seekhein phir jab saya dhal jata to woh farmate utho pas din me se jo baqi reh jaye woh shaitan ke liye hai phir woh un ke paas se guzarte to unhein sakhti se uthate pas jab woh isi haal me the to un se kaha gaya ye Bani Hushaysh ka ek ladka hai jo sher kehta hai to unhon ne use bulaya aur kaha tum ne sher me kya kaha hai to us ne kaha agar tum subah safar par ho to Saleem ko chhor do pas burhapa aur deen e Islam aadmi ko burai se bachane ke liye kafi hain to unhon ne kaha tumhein itna kafi hai tum ne sach kaha tum ne sach kaha."
"1245","Saib bin Yazid rahmatullahi alaih ne kaha Hazrat Umar raziyallahu anhu aadhe din ke qareeb hamare paas se guzarte to farmate utho pas qailula karo pas din me se jo baqi reh jaye woh shaitan ke liye hai."
"1246","Hazrat Anas bin Malik raziyallahu anhu se riwayat hai ke woh Juma ki namaz parhte phir qailula karte the."
"1247","Hazrat Anas raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya jab sharab ki hurmat nazil hui to woh sharab jis par Madina wale the woh busr aur khajoor se banai jati thi pas main ek din Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke sahaba ko Hazrat Abu Talha raziyallahu anhu ke ghar me sharab pila raha tha jab ek aadmi guzra to us ne kaha sharab haram kar di gayi hai to unhon ne na poocha kab haram ki gayi aur na muamle ki tehqeeq ki balke kaha ae Anas ye sharab baha do phir Hazrat Umm Sulaim ke ghar me qailula kiya gaya yahan tak ke dhoop ki garmi halki ho gayi aur unhon ne ghusl kiya phir Hazrat Umm Sulaim raziyallahu anha ne unhein khushbu lagai phir woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye to un se muamle ka zikr kiya jaisa us aadmi ne bayan kiya tha Hazrat Anas raziyallahu anhu ne kaha pas us ke baad unhon ne kabhi sharab apne honton par na rakhi."
"1248","Khawwat bin Jubair rahmatullahi alaih ne kaha din ke pehle hisse ka sona jahalat hai aur us ke darmiyan hisse ka sona sunnat hai aur us ke aakhri hisse ka sona himaqat hai."
